        <webprotege:R7wlyRB7ID3Ps1xfcTJH2ai rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">- cuci bersi cabe merah, cabe rawit, potong kasar

- kupas bawang putih, potong halus lalu goreng sampai kering

